### TEST 4: Call Tic-Tac-Toe WITHOUT Token (Should FAIL with 401)
POST http://localhost:8096/api/tictactoe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "difficulty": "EASY",
  "players": ["player1-uuid", "player2-uuid"]
}

### TEST 5: Call Tic-Tac-Toe with INVALID Token (Should FAIL)
POST http://localhost:8096/api/tictactoe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

{
  "difficulty": "EASY",
  "players": ["player1-uuid", "player2-uuid"]
}

